{"title": "Elemental Infusion", "pageid": 28560, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elemental_Infusion", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Elemental Infusion</b> is a passive feature that adds elemental damage to the wearer's next weapon attack, after dealing elemental damage with a spell.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Thunder_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Thunder_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Thunder\" title=\"Thunder\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">Thunder</span></a> damage using a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">Spell</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Cantrip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cantrip\">Cantrip</a>, that element infuses your weapon.\n</p><p>Until the end of your next turn, you deal an additional <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>1d4</b> damage of that element on your first successful weapon attack. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_ElementalGish_ElementalInfusion_Ring_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_ElementalInfusion_Ring_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_ElementalGish_ElementalInfusion_Ring_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\">Ring of Elemental Infusion</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Umr%27a%27ac\" title=\"Umr'a'ac\">Umr'a'ac</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Elemental Infusion can apply its damage bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">multiple times</a> to a single weapon attack.</li>\n<li>The individual elemental damage boost conditions all share the same <code>StackID</code> with each other, meaning only one may be active on a character at a time.  However, the conditions also use a <code>StackType</code> of <code>Overwrite</code>, meaning the last condition applied from the passive is the condition that will actually affect the wearer's next weapon attack.  Due to the way the passive is written, this causes a priority effect where the conditions follow this order of priority (with the later conditions overwriting the earlier conditions):\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\">Acid Infusion</a> &lt; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\">Cold Infusion</a> &lt; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\">Fire Infusion</a> &lt; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f9/Lightning_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Infusion (Condition)\">Lightning Infusion</a> &lt; <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunder_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Thunder Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunder Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Thunder_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thunder_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Thunder Infusion (Condition)\">Thunder Infusion</a>\n<ul><li>This means that if a character attacks an enemy with a spell that deals primarily Fire damage, but is also dealing bonus Thunder damage, the character will be left with Thunder Infusion.</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Acid_Infusion\">Condition: Acid Infusion</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Acid_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid Infusion (Condition)\">Acid Infusion</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> the next time it deals damage with a weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Cold_Infusion\">Condition: Cold Infusion</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Cold_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Cold Infusion (Condition)\">Cold Infusion</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> the next time it deals damage with a weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Fire_Infusion\">Condition: Fire Infusion</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Fire_Infusion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Infusion_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Infusion (Condition)\">Fire Infusion</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity deals an